.TH NOSTR-HOMED-PROVISION-PULL 1 "2026-09-25" "nostr-homed 0.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nostr-homed-provision-pull \- fetch pointer + manifest + chunks into a staging directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nostr-homed-provision pull
\fB\-\-account\-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
[\fB\-\-dest\fR \fIDIR\fR]
[\fB\-\-allow\-insecure\fR]
[\fB\-\-relay\-timeout\-ms\fR \fIMS\fR]
[\fB\-\-helper\fR \fIPATH\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Forks and executes
.BR nostr-home-fetch (1)
with the account file's pubkey, home_key, relay list, and Blossom list, and
materializes the current pointer + manifest + chunks into a staging
directory. Semantics (SSRF gate, per-chunk timeout, size caps) mirror the
broker's PROVISION_HOME code path exactly \(em this is the same helper the
broker uses, invoked with the same control JSON.
.PP
Use \fBpull\fR to bootstrap a new machine from an existing account file,
or to recover a snapshot on demand without waiting for
.BR nostr-home-syncd (8).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-account\-file \fIPATH\fR
0600 account file (see
.BR nostr-homed-provision-enroll (1)).
Required.
.TP
.B \-\-dest \fIDIR\fR
Materialize the home into DIR. Default: an
.BR mkdtemp (3)
directory under
.IR $TMPDIR .
The path is printed on stdout after a successful fetch.
.TP
.B \-\-allow\-insecure
Pass \fB\-\-allow\-insecure\fR through to the fetch helper. Permits http://
URLs and private/link-local Blossom hosts.
.TP
.B \-\-relay\-timeout\-ms \fIMS\fR
Total budget for the pointer fetch (kind-30078 REQ). Default 10000.
.TP
.B \-\-helper \fIPATH\fR
Override the fetch helper binary. Default:
.IR $CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_LIBEXECDIR/nostr-homed/nostr-home-fetch .
.TP
.B \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH EXIT CODES
Exit codes are forwarded verbatim from
.BR nostr-home-fetch (1):
.RS
.TP 4
.B 0
Success.
.TP 4
.B 64
Bad argument.
.TP 4
.B 65
SSRF gate rejected a Blossom host or scheme.
.TP 4
.B 71
Network failure (relay unreachable, Blossom 5xx, DNS).
.TP 4
.B 72
Manifest decode failure.
.TP 4
.B 73
Size cap exceeded (chunk or manifest).
.TP 4
.B 74
Timeout.
.TP 4
.B 75
Decrypt failure.
.TP 4
.B 76
Internal error.
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
Restore a home from a fresh checkout of the account file:
.PP
.RS
.nf
nostr-homed-provision pull \\
    \-\-account\-file ~/.config/nostr-homed/abcd1234.account.json \\
    \-\-dest /tmp/porthome-restore
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I <dest>/**
Materialized home tree.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nostr-homed-provision (1),
.BR nostr-home-fetch (1)
